se she admires the student council president, Maho. She is also the current dorm leader."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11429"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会副会長で、望月真帆の有能な後輩としてかわいがられ、周囲からも次期生徒会長として有望視されています。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや潔癖症で理想主義的な傾向があり、融通が利かないこともあります。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"望月真帆に対して、やや先輩後輩以上の感情をもつ傾向があり、特に彼女へ近づく男子学生 （筧） に対して敵愾心を見せます。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2913","sourceWorkId":"18942","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"《大图书馆的牧羊人》及其衍生作品中登场的角色。汐美学园2年生，学生会副会长，作为望月真帆的有才后辈而受宠，也被周围期待成为下一代的学生会长。 有点洁癖且理想主义化，有点不太讲情面。 对望月真帆有着前辈后辈之上的感情，特别对接近她的男生（笕京太郎）露出明显的敌意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原作中不可攻略。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在Fan Disc《大图书馆的牧羊人 -Dreaming Sheep-》中为可攻略角色。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27980"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"height":[{"comparisonValue":"152","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11429","value":"152"},{"comparisonValue":"151.9","scope":"sourceWork","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2913","sourceWorkId":"18942","value":"151.9"},{"comparisonValue":"151.9","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27980","value":"151.9cm"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/375f95ad175149c93c03f2a5c37d94e6770a4e27f47e5c3eba0ea641f6df877e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a80665f95f6c1fb9978d97305a221160a09a1ad025ea867655e99d08dc8aa46a.webp","width":70,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞沢渓","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:80828:27980:5741:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c13612","characterName":"土岐 のぞみ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21213","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"70817"}],"egsCharacterId